    "description": "Capture whether a redeposit is required, which type(s), and — only when Immediate applies — the redeposit range.\n\n=== FIELDS ===\n\n* Redeposit Required — Checkbox or Yes/No picklist\n\n* Redeposit Type — Picklist: Assigned; Immediate. Joyce corrected the label live: 'it shouldn't be standard, it should be assigned.' BUILD-120's card body still says 'Standard Redeposit' and needs fixing.\n\n* Immediate Redeposit Range Min / Max — numeric, conditionally visible\n\n=== IMPLEMENTATION REQUIREMENTS ===\n\n* Range fields appear only when Redeposit Type includes Immediate. Joyce: 'if we do require an immediate, then that's when redeposits require range, but if there is no immediate, then you don't actually need to attach a range to redeposit requirements.'\n\n* Conditional visibility via Dynamic Forms field visibility — same mechanism as BUILD-130, now proven in the org.\n\n=== OPEN QUESTIONS ===\n\n* Single-select or multi-select? Joyce said 'we need to specify at a deal level if we require both' and 'Do we need an assigned redeposit and an immediate redeposit?' — 'if we require both' implies multi-select. BUILD-120 already assumes multi-select. Confirm, because it changes the visibility formula.\n\n=== NOTES ===\n\n* The original card body was already accurate. Added the multi-select question, the Standard-to-Assigned label correction, and the visibility mechanism.\n\n=== SOURCE ===\n\n* Aug 11 call — Joyce 30:56, 51:07\n\nDependencies: BUILD-158 (mirror the range pattern)\n\nRemember to update the requirements documentation as part of this change.\n\nPolished 2026-08-17 from the Operator/Partner ticket review, approved by Kobi.",
